  "title": "Caesars Entertainment and Harrah’s Cherokee Casinos Present $1M Donation to Eastern Band of Cherokee Indians to Support New Intellectual and Developmental Disabilities Center",
  "summary": "CHEROKEE, N.C. (Thursday, July 30, 2026) Caesars Entertainment and Harrahs Cherokee Casinos presented a $1 million donation to the Eastern Band of Cherokee Indians last Wednesday, July 29 to support the development of a new Intellectual and Developmental Disabilities Center serving Cherokee individuals and families. The donation will help advance facility improvements and related support for a dedicated center designed to expand access to services, resources and care for individua",
